  id: memory_2
  titleEN: "Memory II \u2014 Lanterns on the Lake"
  titleID: "Kenangan II \u2014 Lentera di Danau"
  memory: 1
  music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3da5ac83c4bd77f4e80e1484990b8e80, type: 3}
  slides:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab14ac2de6f41474fa4ec180e7cceeb7, type: 3}
    textEN: Willow Lake, the night of the lantern festival. That is where I met your
      grandmother, Rose.
    textID: Danau Willow, malam festival lentera. Di sanalah aku bertemu nenekmu,
      Rose.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d9bcd2b18176844e95f78eb27fb16b7, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: df56c97c1287c9349bc448a79ab8f17a, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: -0.02}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 06fcf5bed45842b48abcb19cba1354ba, type: 3}
    textEN: She laughed at my crooked lantern. I said a koi would carry it to the
      moon. It sank instead.
    textID: Ia menertawakan lenteraku yang miring. Kubilang seekor koi akan membawanya
      ke bulan. Lentera itu malah tenggelam.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff0b3b6369e03794f9059e1f25f86b6e, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d676d5bc38438e648bdaf84ed964e974, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: -0.02, y: 0.01}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: 0}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fd7de14bdbd6d82409c1679b00137991, type: 3}
    textEN: But a koi rose, glowing like a lantern. Rose said it was a blessing.
      We were married that spring.
    textID: Tapi seekor koi muncul, bercahaya seperti lentera. Rose bilang itu berkah.
      Musim semi itu kami menikah.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 623c594265ac1214c9926aca7dc3e991, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b3c4733d93072494f89ba48896c15600, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0.02, y: -0.01}
    panTo: {x: -0.01, y: 0.02}
